      "cof:title": "2(3) Commencement",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 5,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If Schedule 1 (other than items 2 and 3) does not commence under\nsubsection (2) within the period of 6 months beginning on the day\non which this Act receives the Royal Assent, it commences on the\nfirst day after the end of that period."
