      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Schedule(s)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 5,
      "values:originalText": "Subject to section 2, each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this\nAct is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the\nSchedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act\nhas effect according to its terms.\n\nSection 3"
