      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(4) Nothing in this section derogates from the right to use the\nprovisions of Part 1D as authority for the taking of fingerprints\nfrom a prescribed offender or a serious offender.\n(5) In subsection (4), prescribed offender and serious offender have\nthe meanings given in subsection 23WA(1).",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n(4) Nothing in this section derogates from the right to use the\nprovisions of Part 1D as authority for the taking of fingerprints\nfrom a prescribed offender or a serious offender.\n(5) In subsection (4), prescribed offender and serious offender have\nthe meanings given in subsection 23WA(1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-1-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-1-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f552a1e79bdc74d313b3f0f000e309faa363c9b81f8db6b9d0fb2b41f0dcea48"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001#sch-1-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 At the end of section 3ZL",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(4) Nothing in this section derogates from the right to use the\nprovisions of Part 1D as authority for the taking of fingerprints\nfrom a prescribed offender or a serious offender.\n(5) In subsection (4), prescribed offender and serious offender have\nthe meanings given in subsection 23WA(1)."
    },
