      "cof:title": "1(5) At the end of section 3ZL",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In subsection (4), prescribed offender and serious offender have\nthe meanings given in subsection 23WA(1)."
    },
