      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\norder means:\n(a) in relation to a suspect—an order of a magistrate under\nsection 23WS or interim order of a magistrate under\nsection 23XA; or\n(b) in relation to an offender—an order of a judge or magistrate\nunder section 23XWO; or\n(c) in relation to a volunteer—an order of a magistrate under\nsection 23XWU.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\norder means:\n(a) in relation to a suspect—an order of a magistrate under\nsection 23WS or interim order of a magistrate under\nsection 23XA; or\n(b) in relation to an offender—an order of a judge or magistrate\nunder section 23XWO; or\n(c) in relation to a volunteer—an order of a magistrate under\nsection 23XWU.",
