      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n; (k) that information obtained from analysis of forensic material\nobtained may be placed on the DNA database system and the\nrules that will apply to its disclosure and use under this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n; (k) that information obtained from analysis of forensic material\nobtained may be placed on the DNA database system and the\nrules that will apply to its disclosure and use under this Part.",
