      "values:originalText": "(6A) A magistrate must not give leave under paragraph (6)(b) unless the\nmagistrate is of the opinion that there are substantial reasons why,\nin the interests of justice, the witness should be called or\ncross-examined.",
      "skos:definition": "(6A) A magistrate must not give leave under paragraph (6)(b) unless the\nmagistrate is of the opinion that there are substantial reasons why,\nin the interests of justice, the witness should be called or\ncross-examined.",
