      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "23XWA  Preventing the carrying out of forensic procedure\nA person is guilty of an offence if the person obstructs, hinders or\nresists a person carrying out a forensic procedure in accordance\nwith this Part.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.",
      "skos:definition": "23XWA  Preventing the carrying out of forensic procedure\nA person is guilty of an offence if the person obstructs, hinders or\nresists a person carrying out a forensic procedure in accordance\nwith this Part.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.",
