      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The constable must, at the time of, or as soon as practicable after,\nmaking an order under section 23XWK, make a record of:\n(a) the order; and\n(b) the date and time when the order was made; and\n(c) the reasons for making it, and sign the record.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The constable must, at the time of, or as soon as practicable after,\nmaking an order under section 23XWK, make a record of:\n(a) the order; and\n(b) the date and time when the order was made; and\n(c) the reasons for making it, and sign the record.",
      "values:partOf": {
