      "values:originalText": "(4) An authorised applicant may apply to any judge or magistrate for\nan order for the taking of the fingerprints under this Division of a\nchild or an incapable person who is a prescribed offender.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An authorised applicant may apply to any judge or magistrate for\nan order for the taking of the fingerprints under this Division of a\nchild or an incapable person who is a prescribed offender.",
