      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In subsection (1), Division 6 person means a person who, under\nDivision 6 as applied by section 23XWE, may carry out the\nforensic procedure.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In subsection (1), Division 6 person means a person who, under\nDivision 6 as applied by section 23XWE, may carry out the\nforensic procedure.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-26-2"
