      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “is destroyed”, substitute “obtained as a result of the carrying out\nof the procedure is destroyed as soon as practicable after the\ndisallowance”.",
