      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001.pdf, p.41",
      "values:originalText": "missing\npersons\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\n7.\nunknown\ndeceased\npersons\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nno\n(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:\n(a) the person’s conduct causes the matching that is not\npermitted by this Part of a DNA profile on an index of the\nDNA database system with a DNA profile on the same or\nanother index of the DNA database system; and\n(b) the person is reckless as to any such matching of profiles.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.\n(3) This section does not make it an offence for conduct to cause a\nmatching that is not permitted by this Part if the matching is solely\nfor the purposes of administering the DNA database system.",
      "skos:definition": "missing\npersons\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\n7.\nunknown\ndeceased\npersons\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nno\n(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:\n(a) the person’s conduct causes the matching that is not\npermitted by this Part of a DNA profile on an index of the\nDNA database system with a DNA profile on the same or\nanother index of the DNA database system; and\n(b) the person is reckless as to any such matching of profiles.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.\n(3) This section does not make it an offence for conduct to cause a\nmatching that is not permitted by this Part if the matching is solely\nfor the purposes of administering the DNA database system.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3ff6676fd26d920d777343145460919151429bf8037b590bea785f5dbd693232"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001#sch-1-sec-6-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Section 6",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 41,
      "values:originalText": "missing\npersons\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\n7.\nunknown\ndeceased\npersons\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nyes\nno\n(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:\n(a) the person’s conduct causes the matching that is not\npermitted by this Part of a DNA profile on an index of the\nDNA database system with a DNA profile on the same or\nanother index of the DNA database system; and\n(b) the person is reckless as to any such matching of profiles.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.\n(3) This section does not make it an offence for conduct to cause a\nmatching that is not permitted by this Part if the matching is solely\nfor the purposes of administering the DNA database system."
    },
